cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "dreamforge: turn world-model imagination into corrective training data for robot policies"
abstract: >-
  A single-GPU pipeline that mines a vision-language-action policy's failure
  states, uses a latent world model to search corrective action chunks with CEM,
  verifies every correction by replaying the exact simulator state, and measures
  whether training on the corrections improves the policy.
type: software
